01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:46.95,Title,,0,0,240,,GatzDialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:49.84,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He did it!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:53.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He really took down Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,He did it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa is saved!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.85,0:02:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,By a rubber ball!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he isn't just some rubber ball.Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,According to King Riku, he is...Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,the pirate Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:32.18,Main,,0,0,0,,No, wait a minute...Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,His face looks scarier, and his body's rounder than the guy in the newspaper.Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that really him?Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:49.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard he's like an eight-meter tall monster.Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.94,Main,,0,0,0,,This guy's four meters at most.Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Then he's a fake?Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, rubber ball. Are you really the Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys're bugging me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep bouncing up and down?Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you stop?Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Nope.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that? I just heard something loud!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola?Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,...won!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:22.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What destructive strength! There's no way he's still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey. Look up, in the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.62,Main,,0,0,0,,No good!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:16.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage isn't gone!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Just one more strike!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter, Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Jesus Burgess! Why was he here at the Palace?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He jumped down! I can't believe how far he can jump!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sabo-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Come in! Hello?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat bastard's half-dead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:49.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The captain of the first ship of Emperor Blackbeard's pirate crew...Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"Champion" Burgess!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, then rob you of...Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,the Rubber Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't just walk right up to him. He's a pirate too!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You never know what they're thinking.Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:30.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What a terrible thing to say! He fought Doflamingo for us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:31.81,Main,,0,0,0,,She's right!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least, he's not our enemy.Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't trust him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku told us that he's our only hope!Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Is the battle over?Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Doflamingo?Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away from the town!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The fight between the pirates is still going on!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get caught up in it! Get outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Even downtown's in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage is closing in! There's no place to run!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Min... go...Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:08.45,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,H-he can't fight anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you go near him, you'll get caught up in their fight and die! Don't get involved!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away from the pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat the Pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize me?Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:03.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The announcer from the Colosseum, Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.65,0:10:09.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The unknown gladiator, Lucy's true identity...Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,was you, wasn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:14.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,There aren't many small guys who are that strong!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's on his way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do about your duel?Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do?Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I need ten minutes...Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,After I use Bound-Man, I can't use Haki for ten minutes afterward.Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Boun...Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta keep my distance,Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:11:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,but I dunno what he's gonna do during that time.Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can regain my Haki,Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can settle this in one blow!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, his horrible reign will be over?Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, if we give you ten minutes, you'll free us from the bird cage, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:45.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:52.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes! We'll leave it up to you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on us! Ten minutes'll pass by in a flash!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You better come back quick and bring down that damn Dofla, Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all competitors from the tournament!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The ones who wouldn't help you earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.75,0:12:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We were blinded by greed over the bounty on your heads!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We didn't even dream that Doflamingo could be driven into a corner!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,As a token of our apology, we'll put our trust in you and risk our lives!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:38.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If we happen to beat him first, sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Mr. Heavenly Yaksha!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you hang out with us for a while?Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes, here he comes!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Kick his ass!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, now's our chance!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The remaining half of you, follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:34.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Die, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Burgess?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That guy...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the three-star outlaw!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army's Chief of Staff!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I am Sabo of the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is my little brother!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Something you want from him, Burgess?Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is your brother?Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I've heard that somewhere before.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:01.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace said the same thing, didn't he? The three of us are brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,After the duel on Banaro Island, you, the Blackbeard Pirates, captured Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the trigger for that damnable Paramount War.Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace lived his own life the way he chose to. I'm not holding a grudge against you or anything...Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm watching Luffy's back from now on!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember that!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in your relationship to him!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way. I've got no business with you or the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I only have business with...Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No business with me? Not even personally?Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. That was you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Flame?Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You've taken some real damage.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:17.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's on his way, and I think my hands'll be full with Burgess.Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Cats and the others will buy me some time.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take down Mingo, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You've become so dependable!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave this one to me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:33.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You ate Ace's Fruit, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let anybody else have it. It's a memento of him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking that power!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of him, Pets!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Gatz, and I will!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Galleon...Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Lariat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Burning Dragon Claw Fist!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,So hot!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Flame Dragon King!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:55.53,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Can't believe it! He blew away a subordinate of one of the Four Emperors!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Powerful! That's what I'd expect from the Revolutionary Army's second-in-command!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as he saw the Flame Fruit's power, he changed his focus to me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,So his objective is...Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,...as they say.Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,He's hunting down Devil Fruit users.Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:18.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lucy! What gives?Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you won the competition and took the Flame Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The Lucy in the finals wasn't me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:29.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I had somewhere to be, so Sabo took my place.Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's what happened. That's against the rules!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,But it all worked out, yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Inheriting your late brother's ability makes for an exciting story.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, your recovery is the only hope Dressrosa has left!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that bastard? He still has the energy to do this?Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate! We gotta stall him as much as we can!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Annoying weaklings! I don't need any energy to wipe you out!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret everything.Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard, Doflamingo! He'll go to any length!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What else is he gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.80,Main,,0,0,0,,First he made the bird cage, and now he's turning the town into strings!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa is done for!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:26.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Just run! The only way to survive is to get away from the downtown area!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole area's a war zone! If you get caught up in it, you're dead meat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get cut up by that bird cage crap!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry toward the downtown area!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out! I'm gonna get crushed!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I have children!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:57.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, why're you running in the opposite direction?! We gotta get to the downtown area!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Downtown's a war zone now!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Then...Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Where do we run?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku, what are we supposed to do?Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Armament...Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Zoro-dono? Trying to stop it with your swords?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It is not something you can stop by merely pushing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,How would you know?Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have time to jabber on that it's impossible, then gimme a hand, you slow-ass idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just one person's ability!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no real reason for me to believe I can't stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we, Kin'emon?Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We shall!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.53,0:22:17.85,Captions,,0,0,175,,In Front of the Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:20.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You ready?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We are!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The factory's made of Sea Stone! It can't be damaged!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me see that freakish strength of yours!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Ready!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Push the factory!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Push, push!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:49.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:52.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet, not yet! Push, push!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.49,0:22:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:58.43,Captions,,0,0,175,,Royal Palace Grounds - Level 2Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:01.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro and the others are pushing against the bird cage?Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it even possible to stop it?Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I would have never thought of it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger! That's so like him.Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:21.00,Captions,,0,0,240,,Royal Palace Grounds South SideDialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.89,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the will of the young master!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Get out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,How rude.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Come no closer! These are the New Royal Grounds!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Only members of the Donquixote Family may enter!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What "Family"? Even the commanders are gone!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is the safest place to be! Let us climb up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You damn fools are condemned criminals!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.24,0:24:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The young master has decreed that this country will be completely cleansed!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier...Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:25.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta our way, left-overs!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the fighters from the Colosseum!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.58,0:24:32.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hajrudin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.02,0:24:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Don Chinjao!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.66,0:24:46.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Army Commander Kyros is here, too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,How am I able to move?Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering the same thing. I didn't think I could move with those injuries.Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.73,0:24:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down just yet!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.92,0:25:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,By decision of Princess Mansherry, Dressrosa has been placed on life support!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.21,0:25:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Life support?Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.40,0:25:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, dwarf?Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.06,0:25:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, everybody! Claw your way to the plateau!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The center of the bird cage is moving this way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved us, Kyros-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.02,0:25:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, men don't depend on others!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Those of you who are able-bodied, come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? "Come with me"?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:33.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where're ya going?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.43,0:25:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:39.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's not gonna come out, I'm gonna make him come out!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's...Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.26,0:26:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it moving faster than before?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:08.85,Main,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage is closing in even faster!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.70,0:26:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Please save us, Your Majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.76,0:26:30.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.98,0:26:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't make it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.52,0:26:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Push! Put more power into it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:46.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.93,0:26:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.94,0:27:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We're being pushed back!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's speeding up... Don't let it get the better of you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.18,0:27:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Push harder than you've ever pushed before!Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.58,0:27:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.94,0:27:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, now's our chance to show off!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.95,0:27:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.14,0:27:39.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Help us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! It's shrinking faster!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:58.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Three minutes remain until the bird cage reaches the downtown area and the blood bath begins.Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.70,0:28:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:06.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Four minutes remain until Luffy's Haki is regained.Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.74,0:28:12.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This leaves a one minute difference between the moment the bird cage closes completely and the moment Luffy awakens.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:15.67,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Datenshi, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis